  "description": "YITAMOTOR factory brand packaging, Each cover is custom-built to ensure precise compatibility with the 6'7\" (6.5 ft) bed of 2019-2026 Chevrolet Silverado and GMC Sierra 1500 new body style. Made from high-quality, commercial-grade vinyl that will not stretch, fade or crack.\nFitment\n2019 Chevy Silverado & GMC Sierra 1500(New Body Style)Fleetside 6'7\" bed\n2020-2026 Chevy Silverado & GMC Sierra 1500 Fleetside 6'7\" bed\nNOTE:\nPlease measure your truck bed size or contact your dealer to confirm the correct model before ordering.\nCab size does not matter as long as you have the correct model and bed size.\nFeatures\nGreat Fit:\nReliable manufacture brand packaging; Each cover is custom-built to\nensure precise compatibility with the 6'7\" (6.6 ft) bed of 2019-2026 Chevy Silverado & GMC Sierra.\nEasy Installation: No tools or drilling required; Upgraded clamps with\nadjustable holes allow for an easy installation within 20 minutes; user\nfriendly design for easy assembly and dis-assembly.\nSafety First: Latch lock and adjustable tension system on the end of\nthe side rails keep the cover close tightly; sturdy clamps and buckles\nwith straps protect the cover from sliding or blowing off while driving.\nGreat Quality: Made with double layer PVC on the top, structured with\nsolid alloy in the frame, this back cover is build to last for your\ntruck.\nAll season Protection: Features tear resistant, water resistance, high\ntemperature resistance, no matter where you are or what the weather is\nlike, we’ve got you covered.\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.",
